      <link>https://www.boisestatepublicradio.org/news/2026-02-26/baker-country-market-amish-fire-salmon</link>
      <description>In a small town just nine miles east of Salmon, a beloved, Amish-owned market burned to the ground Saturday evening. The Baker Country Market opened in 2015, and was run by the Miller family. It became something of a landmark and popular destination for tourists and locals alike.</description>
